{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/厄兆疫变","pageid":9329,"revid":22675,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8E%84%E5%85%86%E7%96%AB%E5%8F%98&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8E%84%E5%85%86%E7%96%AB%E5%8F%98&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8E%84%E5%85%86%E7%96%AB%E5%8F%98&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>厄兆疫变</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8E.84.E5.85.86.E7.96.AB.E5.8F.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"厄兆疫变\"><b>厄兆疫变</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 厄兆疫变.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4e/r1huij63y6xghjh3256yru3qiodksft.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8E%84%E5%85%86%E7%96%AB%E5%8F%98.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4e/r1huij63y6xghjh3256yru3qiodksft.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8E%84%E5%85%86%E7%96%AB%E5%8F%98.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4e/r1huij63y6xghjh3256yru3qiodksft.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />厄兆疫变\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（减益）选择地形格，对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人，重复<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次此效果：从[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"流血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">流血</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"点燃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">点燃</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冻伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冻伤</font></span></span>]中按顺序施加尚未拥有的<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个（持续2回合），皆有时，则施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剧毒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">剧毒</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）和<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"感染\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">感染</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：战斗开始时及<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>倍数的战斗回合开始时，对场上所有敌人施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>种[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"厄兆疫变\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">厄兆疫变</font></span></span>]，在受到下<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次指定技能攻击前触发。<br />[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"流血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">流血</font></span></span>]：受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"沙属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">沙属性</font></span></span>]或范围技能前施加。<br />[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"点燃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">点燃</font></span></span>]：受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"火属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">火属性</font></span></span>]或单体技能前施加。<br />[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冻伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冻伤</font></span></span>]：受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰属性</font></span></span>]或穿透技能前施加。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-4 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/46/8haq5yodeiuouyj76phrrm0ut26c0ub.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"81\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/46/8haq5yodeiuouyj76phrrm0ut26c0ub.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/46/8haq5yodeiuouyj76phrrm0ut26c0ub.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"223\" data-file-height=\"226\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%96%87%E4%BD%A9%E6%8B%89\" title=\"角色图鉴库/薇佩拉\"><img alt=\"头像 薇佩拉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b2/gcyru93jk2xwxde8ynx0qkx17mvogxa.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">薇佩拉</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-eve